    "examTrap": "The Hessian $\\nabla^2 f(x)$ must be evaluated at an INTERMEDIATE point $x + \\theta d$ for exact equality! Evaluating at $x$ requires adding the asymptotic remainder term $o(\\|d\\|^2)$."
