    "math": "$$\\kappa(\\nabla^2 q(c, x)) = \\frac{\\lambda_{\\max}}{\\lambda_{\\min}} \\approx \\mathcal{O}(c) \\xrightarrow{c \\to \\infty} \\infty \\implies \\text{Catastrophic Numerical Instability}$$",
